# Full evaluation dumps are large and regenerated by `make eval`.
reports/*.png
reports/results*.json
reports/final_s*.json
reports/rep*.json
reports/omp*.json
reports/det*.json

# The two exported payloads ARE committed: they are what the pages inline,
# so a clone can rebuild the site without re-running the 5-minute pipeline.
!reports/ui_data.json
!reports/landing_data.json
